        "Second-declension masculine: -οι, -ους, -ων, -οις. Second-declension neuter: -α, -α, -ων, -οις.",
        "First-declension feminine: -αι, -ας, -ῶν, -αις.",
        "Adjectives match their nouns in gender, number, and case.",
